growth company <span id="xdx_90C_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20240722__20240722_zIW5L8OfA407"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-07-22" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000034" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

