with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span id="xdx_90A_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20240722__20240722_zzCkxJ7ASkn4"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-07-22" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000035" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

